      },
      "level": {
        "value": 18
      },
      "privateNotes": "<p><strong>@UUID[Compendium.points-of-interest.journals.JournalEntry.jxn9bB1XhZTRpF65.JournalEntryPage.O5rNFDKxgn9WE38b]{21. The Annihilator}.</strong> Burns structures, then growth, then collects survivors in four stasis bays and delivers them to the Iron Juggernaut (#9). Custom conversion from the stat block in the encounter.</p>",
      "publicNotes": "<p>An annihilator robot ranges out of the Skyfall Wastes on orders older than any living nation: burn structures, destroy growth, and collect survivors. It carries captives in four stasis bays and brings them to the docking cradle on the Iron Juggernaut's loop, where it transfers them into the Juggernaut's hold.</p>\n<h2>Appearance</h2>\n<p>A massive four-legged war machine of dark grey adamantine plating scarred by ages of use, with clawed legs and a long segmented tail curled over its back, ending in a plasma lance emitter. Twin chain gun barrels on its shoulders. A sensor cluster glows red on its head plate. Four armoured hatches line its flank; one bulges as if struck from inside.</p>",
      "publication": {
        "license": "OGL",
        "remaster": true,
        "title": "Points of Interest (conversion of the Pathfinder RPG annihilator robot)"
      }
