        "category": "interaction",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The annihilator picks up an unconscious or dying creature within its reach and seals them in a stasis bay. The creature stops making recovery checks and its dying value can't increase while inside. Opening a bay takes two Interact actions and a @Check[thievery|dc:38] check, or destroying the annihilator. A bay holds one creature; the annihilator has four bays.</p>"
